p: .
t. 
|  The source of these claims was, in fact, the DA’s counselor, who in turn heard
|  them from a social worker who had met the mother at the battered women’s
|  shelter and (according to the mother) had pressured her to place her son with a
.  foster care agency with which the social worker was professionally connected


--- Sentence/switch
id: 717
r#  67259  1270  78

--- Paragraph/end 
