|  Perhaps the most outrageous thing about these surprise visits was that CPS never
|  gave any reason for insisting on them. Normally such tactics are used when parents are accused of inadequate care such as unsanitary conditions or lack of
|  food - conditions that can be concealed if the parents know when to expect a
|  CPS visit. In this case, in the absence of any such charge, the visits were clearly
.  intended mainly to harass and frighten the mother - which they did.9


